---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Explore the Library · America's School Trust Library"
  description="A directory of the Library's main pages."
  sourceId="explore"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-a:text-blue-700 prose-a:underline">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Explore</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Explore the Library</h1>

    <p class="kicker text-slate-600">
      A directory of the Library's main pages.
    </p>

    <h2>School Trusts</h2>
    <ul class="room-list">
      <li><a href="/start/"><strong>School trust basics</strong></a> — school trust lands: a primer.</li>
      <li><a href="/states/"><strong>Find your state</strong></a> — the state-by-state record.</li>
      <li><a href="/atlas/"><strong>Compare states</strong></a> — what every federal-grant state did with its school-trust lands.</li>
      <li><a href="/maps/"><strong>State land maps</strong></a> — state-by-state cartography of the trust geography.</li>
      <li><a href="/court/"><strong>Law &amp; court cases</strong></a> — the court record.</li>
      <li><a href="/counting/"><strong>Trust finances</strong></a> — the financial record. How much, where, and what was lost.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Read &amp; Research</h2>
    <ul class="room-list">
      <li><a href="/reading/"><strong>Books &amp; documents</strong></a> — book-length works on America's school trust lands.</li>
      <li><a href="/writing/"><strong>Writing Room</strong></a> — where the long-form arguments live.</li>
      <li><a href="https://parcelchronicle-refdesk.drdavesullivan.workers.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Research your land's history</strong> <span class="beta-badge">Beta</span><span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/catalog/"><strong>Catalog</strong></a> — the Library's full index.</li>
      <li><a href="/search/"><strong>Search</strong></a> — search the whole collection.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>News</h2>
    <ul class="room-list">
      <li><a href="/newsroom/"><strong>School trust news</strong></a> — a weekly survey of what's changing across the fifty states.</li>
      <li><a href="/voices/"><strong>Commentary</strong></a> — signed editorial pieces from named contributors.</li>
      <li><a href="/updates/"><strong>Library updates</strong></a> — the Library's milestones.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get Involved</h2>
    <ul class="room-list">
      <li><a href="/contribute/"><strong>Ways to help</strong></a> — send a source, correct a page, help maintain a state.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>About</h2>
    <ul class="room-list">
      <li><a href="/about/"><strong>About the Library</strong></a> — who runs the Library, and how to reach us.</li>
      <li><a href="/booklet/"><strong>Library introduction (booklet)</strong></a> — the Library in brief.</li>
      <li><a href="/librarians/"><strong>How the Library is made</strong></a> — how this library is made.</li>
      <li><a href="/pro/"><strong>Standards &amp; policies</strong></a> — governance, editorial standards, collection-development policy, roles.</li>
      <li><a href="/about/corrections/"><strong>Corrections</strong></a> — the corrections ledger.</li>
      <li><a href="/about/cite/"><strong>How to cite</strong></a> — citation formats for Library pages.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .room-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .beta-badge {
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--old-gold, #b08d57);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #7a5c1e;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .room-list li {
    margin: 0.4rem 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
